{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Iterative Network Prompt Feedback.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Iterative Network Prompt Feedback.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"iterative network prompt feedback iterative network prompt feedback","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Iterative Network Prompt Feedback.md","fileName":"Iterative Network Prompt Feedback.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Iterative Network Prompt Feedback","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-27 18:30\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Network AI Model and Prompt Engineering]]","tags":[],"links":[],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Iterative Network Prompt Feedback.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Iterative Network Prompt Feedback.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"iterative network prompt feedback iterative network prompt feedback","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Iterative Network Prompt Feedback.md","fileName":"Iterative Network Prompt Feedback.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Iterative Network Prompt Feedback","heading":"Iterative Network Prompt Feedback","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Iterative prompt feedback treats the first model response as a draft. An engineer reviews it, identifies concrete defects or missing requirements, and supplies those observations in a subsequent turn. The retained conversation lets the model revise the same artifact rather than beginning from an unrelated prompt.\n\nFeedback is most useful when it names evidence: an ACL omitted return traffic, a command targets the wrong operating system, or a required validation step is absent. The final artifact still needs independent review because repeated agreement inside one conversation can reinforce an earlier mistake. For complex work, feedback pairs well with [[Layered Network Prompt Construction]].","tags":[],"links":[],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Iterative Network Prompt Feedback.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Iterative Network Prompt Feedback.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"iterative network prompt feedback iterative network prompt feedback","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Iterative Network Prompt Feedback.md","fileName":"Iterative Network Prompt Feedback.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Iterative Network Prompt Feedback","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[ainetworkingcookbook.pdf]]","tags":[],"links":[],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}